# ==============================================================================
# BookMyMovie - TMDB REST API Configuration (Unit 4 Experiment 1)
# ==============================================================================
# Copy this file to '.env.local' to configure your personal TMDB API key:
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# IMPORTANT SECURITY NOTES:
# 1. Do NOT commit .env or .env.local to GitHub (.gitignore already excludes them).
# 2. Variables prefixed with 'VITE_' are bundled into client-side browser code.
# 3. If no key is set, BookMyMovie automatically runs in offline demo mode using
#    the curated 2026 Tamil (Jailer 2, Jana Nayagan, Indian 3, Dhruva Natchathiram, Coolie)
#    and 2026 Hollywood (Avengers: Doomsday, Project Hail Mary, Scream 7, Mario Galaxy) dataset.
# ==============================================================================

# TMDB (The Movie Database) API v3 Key
# Get a free key at: https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
# Example: VITE_TMDB_API_KEY=3fd2beeb0e5204824e88b2226dcd1721
VITE_TMDB_API_KEY=your_tmdb_api_key_here

# Optional TMDB Base URL (Defaults to https://api.themoviedb.org/3)
VITE_TMDB_BASE_URL=https://api.themoviedb.org/3
